sequenceDiagram
    participant App as "Application<br/>startup"
    participant Spring as "Spring Boot<br/>Environment"
    participant AppYml as "application.yml<br/>(erp-api/src/main/resources)"
    participant YmlCfg as "erp-api<br/>YmlConfig"
    participant AwsModel as "erp-infrastructure<br/>AwsConfigModel"
    participant JsonModel as "erp-infrastructure<br/>JsonplaceholderConfigModel"

    App->>Spring: start
    Spring->>AppYml: load application.yml
    Spring->>YmlCfg: instantiate YmlConfig
    YmlCfg->>Props: load classpath:aws/aws.yml and jsonplaceholder.yml
    Props->>AwsModel: bind aws.s3 -> AwsConfigModel
    Props->>JsonModel: bind jsonplaceholder -> JsonplaceholderConfigModel
    Note right of YmlCfg: centralizes extra YAML property sources
